---

# UI Components

- Functional components with TypeScript prop interfaces; avoid `any`.
- Prefer shadcn primitives from `@/components/ui/` (`Button`, `Card`, `Dialog`, `Input`, `Select`, `Badge`, `Table`).
- Style with Tailwind plus CSS variables: `--foreground`, `--background`, `--card-bg`, `--accent-primary`, `--highlight`, `--border-color`, `--muted`.
- Icons: lucide-react first; `react-icons/fa` only when needed.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` to merge classes.
- Handle loading and error states on every data fetch.
